{
  "info": {
    "name": "Biblioteca API",
    "description": "Coleccion para probar el backend del Sistema de Reserva de Libros.\n\nUso:\n1. Importar esta coleccion en Postman.\n2. Verificar la variable de coleccion baseUrl (por defecto http://localhost:8080/v1).\n3. Levantar el backend (ver README del repositorio).\n4. Ejecutar en orden las carpetas 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4. Los POST guardan los ids creados en variables (idCategoria, idLibro1, idLibro2, idCliente, idReserva) para que las siguientes llamadas los reutilicen.\n5. La carpeta 5 contiene casos de error esperados (400/404).\n\nNota: un script a nivel de coleccion genera un runId aleatorio en cada request para respetar los UNIQUE (isbn, cedula, email), por lo que la coleccion se puede ejecutar varias veces sin limpiar la base.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// runId unico por ejecucion: evita choques en columnas UNIQUE (isbn, cedula, email)",
          "const rid = String(Date.now()).slice(-6) + String(Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000)).padStart(3, '0');",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('runId', rid);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "runId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "idCategoria", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "idLibro1", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "idLibro2", "value": "2", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "idCliente", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "idReserva", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Smoke",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar categorias (health)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categorias", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["categorias"] },
            "description": "Comprueba que el backend responde."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Categorias",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear categoria",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Novela\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Obras de ficcion narrativa\",\n  \"estado\": true\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categorias", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["categorias"] },
            "description": "Crea una categoria y guarda su id en {{idCategoria}}."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "const loc = pm.response.headers.get('Location');",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve Location', function () { pm.expect(loc).to.be.a('string'); });",
                  "if (loc) { pm.collectionVariables.set('idCategoria', loc.split('/').pop()); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar categorias",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/categorias", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["categorias"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener categoria por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
